OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy throughout the
OL,6,Fday with some showers in the morning,
OL,7,Fturning to more persistent rain and
OL,8,Fhill snow through the day. Breezy
OL,9,Faround the coast with fresh easterly
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will stay cloudy through
OL,13,Fthe evening and overnight with further
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain and hill snow, but
OL,15,Fturning generally lighter and more
OL,16,Fpatchy as winds ease overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
