OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FRather cloudy through the
OL,6,Fmorning and afternoon with some patchy
OL,7,Frain. Turning drier with clear spells
OL,8,Fthrough the evening, but still the odd
OL,9,Flight shower.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FThursday and Friday will be chilly
OL,13,Fwith bright spells and a few showers.
OL,14,FDry but chilly on Saturday with bright
OL,15,For sunny spells. Overnight frosts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
